    "catalog:tags": "bath, bathtub, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Bath for an alcove: rim 0.55, a tub 1.52 x 0.56 inside and 0.43 deep, drawn as four rim strips over four wall slabs and a floor, with a front panel. Two pillar taps 0.10 high on the rim at the tap end make the overall height 0.65; the taps build as prisms. Drain and taps sit at the -x end: a mirrored copy keeps drainCenter, faucetMount and the ports where they are.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Drafting standard key dimensions (practice, verify; EN 14516 for baths), not read, unverified; ports BS EN 12056-2 via the drafting standard, not read, unverified",
